Publication boundary clean across all five content files (no private repo/issue/product identifiers; downstream identity intentionally abstract). No statement grants a downstream layer authority to redefine evidence semantics; strengthening-only posture consistent with the Phase 242 direction. Non-goals honored (no forge client, ruleset schema, controller, webhook receiver, signer, or receipt implementation).

